    $J$56fc07f3-e947-52f8-9c1e-6d3b2e0cf210$J$, $J$a1e2ffa1-5176-53f6-8c96-fa80847ac7a9$J$, b.id, $J$human-lineage-capstone$J$, $J$Human Lineage: Genetics and Paleoanthropology Capstone$J$, $J$vertical$J$, $J$Capstone treatment of human evolutionary history using exactly the same evidentiary and causal toolkit as the Speciation and Diversity of Life strand (phylogeny, common ancestry, population genetics, $J$, $J$Capstone treatment of human evolutionary history using exactly the same evidentiary and causal toolkit as the Speciation and Diversity of Life strand (phylogeny, common ancestry, population genetics, extinction) applied to the hominin lineage specifically. Reinforces Variation and Inheritance's Allele/Population/Mutation and Natural Selection and Adaptation's Selection Pressure/Drift throughout, rather than introducing a separate explanatory framework for human evolution -- the central design commitment of this capstone.$J$, 'accepted'
